	'messages:config-db-prefix' => 'en:Database table prefix (no hyphens):',
	'messages:config-db-prefix-help' => 'en:If you need to share one database between multiple wikis, or between MediaWiki and another web application, you may choose to add a prefix to all the table names to avoid conflicts.
Do not use spaces.

